# Data Shell README demo — records docs/demo.gif.
#
# Requires VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs):
#     vhs examples/demo.tape
#
# The walkthrough: refuse poisoned rows, publish clean ones, then prove that a
# post-delivery byte-flip is detected by the signed audit certificate.

Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Theme "Dracula"

Type "datashell demo"
Enter
Sleep 7s

Type "datashell ledger summary"
Enter
Sleep 4s
